            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Clemente, Sara. (2018). A New Head of the Table: Indigenous Peoples at the Forefront of UNDRIP. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/xh917cq6431",
